## PHASE 3: CAPTURE EVIDENCE FOR REPORT

### What to Screenshot / Save

```bash
# 1. Save all Nmap results
nmap -A 192.168.56.101 -oX recon_results.xml -oN recon_results.txt

# 2. View open ports clearly
nmap --open 192.168.56.101

# 3. Check ARP table (shows poisoned entries during ARP attack)
arp -a

# 4. List saved pcap files
ls -la *.pcap
```

