## Important Reminders

- **Only run these on your own lab VMs** — never on real networks or devices you don't own
- After each attack, **restore ARP tables** by stopping arpspoof (it auto-restores)
- Re-enable IP forwarding back to 0 after MiTM: `echo 0 > /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_forward`
- All `.pcap` and `.txt` files are your **simulation files** for submission

This covers Tasks 3 and 4 of your assignment (simulation + defense implementation comes next using `iptables` and Snort/Suricata).
